// ************** MOS-MUSIC OpenHymnal ABC → JPW-ABC 1.0 **************\n// source = sources/openhymnal/OpenHymnal2014.06.abc\n// match = exact title match from content/production/tune-matching.json\n\n.Title\nTitle = 耶稣恩友（What a Friend We Have in Jesus）\nKeyAndMeters = {1=F,4/4}\nWordsByAndMusicBy = Words: Joseph M. Scriven, 1855.\nMusic: 'untitled' Charles C. Converse, 1868.  Setting: "Book of hymns and tunes", 1874.\ncopyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2005 Revision.\nExpression = {♩=100}\n\n.Voice\n5. 5_ 6_ 5_ 4_ 1_ | 1- 6,- | 5,. 1_ 4_ 1_ 5_ 4_ | 2.- 0 | 5. 5_ 6_ 5_ 4_ 1_ | 1- 6,- | 5,. 1_ 4_ 2_ 1_ 7,_ | 1.- 0 | 2. #1_ 2_ 4_ #4_ 2_ | 4- 5- | 6. 6_ 5_ 4_ #4_ 4_ | 2.- 0 | 5. 5_ 6_ 5_ 4_ 1_ | 1- 6,- | 5,. 1_ 4_ 2_ 1_ 7,_ | 1.- 0 |\n\n.Words\nW1@1,1:\n{What} a {Friend} {we} {have} {in} {Je} {sus,} {all} {our} {sins} {and} {griefs} {to} {bear!} {What} a {priv} i {lege} {to} {car} {ry} {ev} {ery} {thing} {to} {God} {in} {prayer!} O {what} {peace} {we} {of} {ten} {for} {feit,} O {what} {need} {less} {pain} {we} {bear,} {All} {be} {cause} {we} {do} {not} {ca} {rry} {ev} {ery} {thing} {to} {God} {in} {prayer.} / / / /\n